BIKHRA HAI RUN MEIN LASHA NOUSHAHE KARBALA<br>
<br>
Shah laash par jo pohonche manzar ajeeb dekha<br>
Shabbar ka laal Qasim tha khoon mein nahaya<br>
Kehte the Shah-e-Deen ye phir se sada do beta <br>
Aansoo baha rahe the sar ko jhukaye Moula<br>
<br>
Maadar ke khwaab toote dulhan ki maang ujdi<br>
Phir is tarah ki koi dekhi gayi na shaadi<br>
The teen din ke bhooke pyaase sabhi baraati<br>
Dhaare hai khoon ki ya dulha ke rukh ka sehra<br>
<br>
Karbobala mein bigdi Kubra bani ki qismat <br>
Kuch der ki dulhan par aayi hai kya musibat<br>
Shaadi ke ghar mein matam Allah re Qayamat<br>
Aankho mein bewagi ka manzar liye hai Kubra<br>
<br>
Maadar ki thi wasiyat zinda na run se aana<br>
Beta chacha se pehle tum jaan apni dena<br>
Qasim ne is ada se wada wafa kiya tha<br>
Sarwar aba mein apni laye uthake laasha<br>
<br>
Tukde aba mein apni Shabbir laarahe hain<br>
Ruk rukke har khadam par aansoo baha rahehain<br>
Ek din mein kitne sadme Sarwar utha rahe hain<br>
Kubra bani ka gham se dil baitha ja raha tha<br>
<br>
Shadi ka ghar elahi matam sara hai kaise<br>
Palkon pa apni lekar ashke aza ke tohfe<br>
Kyun ye Sohail sab hain pehne siyah kapde<br>
Roro ke derahe hain sab Fatima ko pursa
